---
description: Core architecture boundaries for jaha-eye
alwaysApply: true
---

- An **agent** is a saved definition; a **run** is one execution.
- The API never calls `new Agent()` — only `AgentFactory` / `StrandsRuntime`.
- The UI speaks REST and AG-UI SSE only; no Strands types in apps/web.
- Persist every event to `AgentRunEvent` before streaming to the client.
- Phase 1: no Redis, BullMQ, worker, server scheduler, or Langfuse; UI-ticked cron schedules are allowed.
- Do not use `createStrandsApp`; Fastify encodes SSE itself.
